SUMMARY
We explored the development of intelligent chatbots using Amazon Lex, leveraging its natural language understanding capabilities to create interactive and user-friendly experiences. We outlined the process of designing intents, slots, and fulfillment logic, integrating with AWS services like Lambda for backend processing. The chatbot successfully demonstrated its ability to handle user queries and provide efficient, automated responses. This project showcases the potential of using Amazon Lex for creating scalable and versatile chatbot solutions. Future enhancements could include adding multilingual support, improving personalization, integrating sentiment analysis, and scaling the system for wider user access.
